openrgb: OpenRGB RGB lighting control
openrgb:
openrgb: OpenRGB is an open-source application for controlling RGB lighting
openrgb: from compatible motherboards, peripherals, and other devices.
openrgb:
openrgb: This package contains the OpenRGB AppDir and a Slackware wrapper.
openrgb: It does not start a background service.
